{"Wrong language: Italian text was placed into the Lithuanian (`messages_lt.properties`) translation file. `loginTotpStep1` now reads Italian instead of Lithuanian, breaking the Lithuanian locale for this message.": 0.9889591932296753, "This replacement text uses Traditional Chinese characters (\u624b\u6a5f, \u5b89\u88dd, \u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f) in a Simplified Chinese (`zh_CN`) locale file. All other entries in this file use Simplified Chinese consistently.": 0.9782224893569946, "Typo in method name: `santizeAnchors` should be `sanitizeAnchors`.": 0.6013306975364685, "`start + end` can exceed the shorter string's length, causing `StringIndexOutOfBoundsException` in the `substring` calls. For example, if `value=\"aa\"` and `sanitized=\"a\"`, then `start=1` and `end=1`, making `sanitized.substring(1, 0)` throw. Add a guard after both loops to clamp `end`.": 0.823329746723175, "Placeholder format `{0}` is inconsistent with all other `error-*` messages in this file, which use `{{0}}` (i18next interpolation). If the account-ui renders these client-side with i18next, the `{0}` placeholders and `{2,choice,...}` ChoiceFormat pattern will appear literally to the user instead of being interpolated.": 0.7166628837585449, "Typo: stray `n` before `Hvis` \u2014 this is a leftover from the `\\n` newline in the plain-text variant. The `<p>` tag already provides the paragraph break, so the `n` should be removed.": 0.6646181344985962, "Typo: \"Anahatar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131\" should be \"Anahtar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131\" (letters 'h' and 'a' are swapped). Every other occurrence in this file uses the correct spelling.": 0.06719052791595459, "The sentence starts with `\u017eas` which is a truncated word \u2014 it should be `Ka\u017ekas` (\"Someone\"). Compare with the plaintext body which has `Ka\u017eas` (also a typo, missing the second 'k').": 0.5822769403457642, "Typo: `nJei` should be `Jei` \u2014 the leading `n` appears to be a leftover from the `\\n` in the plaintext version. This will render literally as \"nJei\" in the HTML email.": 0.6577464938163757, "`POLICY_SOME_HTML`, `POLICY_NO_HTML`, and `HTML_TAGS` are instance fields named as constants. They should be `private static final` to avoid recreating them per instance and to follow Java naming conventions.": 0.3034321963787079, "Malformed closing tag `</div` is missing its closing `>`. Should be `</div>` to properly test detection of illegal-but-well-formed HTML tags, matching the test's intent.": 0.8587972521781921, "This message switches to `{0}`/`{2,choice...}` ICU syntax, but the admin UI i18next config uses `{{...}}` interpolation with no ICU plugin. The placeholders will render literally instead of being replaced. Keep the `{{0}}` format (or add proper i18next pluralization keys).": 0.8265640735626221, "Missing newline at end of file in noHtml_en.properties. Add a trailing newline to conform to POSIX text file conventions and avoid noisy diffs if a line is appended later.": 0.31985247135162354, "Missing trailing newline at end of file in changedAnchor_en.properties. This can cause issues with certain text-processing tools and produces noisy diffs when a new line is later appended.": 0.3140086233615875, "Missing trailing newline at end of file in noHtml_de.properties. POSIX defines a line as a sequence ending in a newline; some tools may warn or behave unexpectedly with an unterminated final line.": 0.1729932278394699, "Missing explicit `<scope>` on `owasp-java-html-sanitizer` \u2014 the co-added `commons-text` and existing `maven-core` dependency both specify `<scope>compile</scope>` explicitly. Add `<scope>compile</scope>` for consistency.": 0.03523401543498039, "Missing newline at end of file in changedAnchor_de.properties. Add a trailing newline to comply with POSIX text file conventions.": 0.32865166664123535}